{
  "folder": "DXFNWeB3LneJYLhd",
  "name": "Chronokinetic Mastery",
  "type": "feature",
  "_id": "eGTpq8aSbCUvFhEq",
  "img": "icons/magic/time/clock-spinning-gold-pink.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever you use the Inertial Shield ability, you can use the Disengage move action as a free triggered action.</p><p>Additionally, as your discipline grows, your psionic mastery of your body intensifies, granting benefits from the Chronokinetic Mastery table. Benefits are cumulative except where an improved benefit replaces a lesser benefit.</p><table><thead><tr><th><p>Discipline</p></th><th><p>Benefit</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Whenever you use the Knockback maneuver, you can use the Disengage move action as a free triggered action either before or after the maneuver.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>The first time on a turn that you willingly move 1 or more squares as part of an ability, you [[/surge 1]].</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>You gain an edge on the Grab and Knockback maneuvers.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8 (4th Level)</p></td><td><p>The first time on a turn that you willingly move 1 or more squares as part of an ability, you [[/surge 2]].</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10 (7th Level)</p></td><td><p>You have a double edge on the Grab and Knockback maneuvers.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>12 (10th Level)</p></td><td><p>Whenever you force move a target, the forced movement distance gains a bonus equal to your Intuition score. Additionally, whenever you use a heroic ability, you gain [[/heal 10 temp]]</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "director": ""
    },
